  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Africa Regional Transport and Transit Facilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is expected to support the implementation of the first phase the WAEMU/Ghana&#x2019;s Road Program I (RP-I) program. This program is intended to facilitate transport and transit on the Tema -- Ouagadougou -- Bamako corridor as a pilot for other priority corridors.</narrative>
  </description>
